<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#8b5a35">
  <title>
    <%= title %>
  </title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/LOGO TBA.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;800;900&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/output.css">
</head>

<body class="bg-brand-50 font-sans text-stone-900 antialiased">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
      <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-14 md:py-20">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-[520px] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,rgba(255,255,255,0.96),transparent_34%),radial-gradient(circle_at_85%_18%,rgba(139,90,53,0.14),transparent_25%)]">
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto w-[min(100%-1.5rem,1180px)]">
          <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-brand-700">Tentang
              Website</span>
            <h1
              class="mt-5 font-display text-4xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
              Mengenal TBA UMKM lebih dekat</h1>
            <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-stone-600 sm:text-lg">
              TBA UMKM atau yang bisa disebut Teras Bisnis Anak Nagari adalah platform katalog yang menampilkan
              informasi UMKM di Nagari Tanjung Bonai Aur.
              Website ini dibuat untuk memudahkan masyarakat menemukan produk lokal, melihat profil pelaku usaha,
              dan mendukung pertumbuhan ekonomi kreatif di daerah.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
            <article class="rounded-[28px] border border-brand-500/10 bg-white/90 p-7 shadow-soft">
              <span
                class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-500/10 text-2xl">🎯</span>
              <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Tujuan Website</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
                Menyajikan katalog UMKM yang rapi, modern, dan mudah diakses agar produk lokal lebih mudah dikenali oleh
                warga maupun pengunjung.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="rounded-[28px] border border-brand-500/10 bg-white/90 p-7 shadow-soft">
              <span
                class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-500/10 text-2xl">📌</span>
              <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Manfaat Utama</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
                Membantu promosi usaha, memperluas jangkauan informasi, dan menjadi media informasi sederhana untuk
                mengenalkan produk unggulan nagari.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="rounded-[28px] border border-brand-500/10 bg-white/90 p-7 shadow-soft">
              <span
                class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-500/10 text-2xl">💡</span>
              <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Fokus Pengembangan</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
                Tampilan dibuat responsif, konsisten antar halaman, dan mudah dikembangkan untuk fitur tambahan di
                kemudian hari.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="py-14 md:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto w-[min(100%-1.5rem,1180px)]">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
              <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Tim
                Pengembang</span>
              <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl">Tim Pengembang Website</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
            <% team.forEach(function(member) { %>
              <article
                class="rounded-[28px] border border-brand-500/10 bg-white/90 p-7 shadow-soft transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-brand-500/10 bg-brand-50">
                  <img src="<%= member.foto %>" alt="Foto <%= member.nama %>"
                    class="h-56 w-full object-cover object-center">
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">
                  <%= member.nama %>
                </h3>
                <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-600">
                  <div>
                    <dt class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Jurusan</dt>
                    <dd>
                      <%= member.jurusan %>
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <dt class="font-semibold text-stone-900">NIM</dt>
                    <dd>
                      <%= member.nim %>
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <dt class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Nomor HP</dt>
                    <dd>
                      <%= member.hp %>
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                </dl>
              </article>
              <% }); %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>